  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3942,
      "text": "What is the matter with you? How do you judge?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 154,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3943,
      "text": "Will you not then take heed?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 155,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3944,
      "text": "Do you have any compelling proof?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 156,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3945,
      "text": "Then bring your scripture, if you are truthful.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 157,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3946,
      "text": "They claim that there is a kinship between Him and the jinn[37], when the jinn themselves know that such people will surely be brought [for punishment].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 158,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3947,
      "text": "Glorified is Allah far above what they ascribe [to Him].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 159,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3948,
      "text": "But not the chosen slaves of Allah[38].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 160,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3949,
      "text": "So you and whatever you worship",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 161,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3950,
      "text": "none of you can lure anyone away from Him,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 162,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3951,
      "text": "except those who are destined to burn in the Blazing Fire[39].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 163,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3952,
      "text": "[The angels say][40], “There is none among us but has a known station[41]:",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 164,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3953,
      "text": "We are indeed those who stand lined up in rows,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 165,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3954,
      "text": "and we are indeed those who glorify Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 166,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3955,
      "text": "And [the pagans] used to say[42],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 167,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3956,
      "text": "“If only we had a scripture[43] like the previous people,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 168,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3957,
      "text": "we would have surely been true slaves of Allah.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 169,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3958,
      "text": "But they rejected it[44]; soon they will come to know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 170,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3959,
      "text": "Our Word has already been given to Our slaves, the messengers,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 171,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3960,
      "text": "that it is surely they who will be given victory,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 172,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3961,
      "text": "and that Our soldiers will surely be the victors.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 173,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3962,
      "text": "So turn away from them for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 174,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3963,
      "text": "Wait and see; soon they will see [their end].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 175,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3964,
      "text": "Do they really seek to hasten Our punishment?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 176,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3965,
      "text": "When it[45] descends on their courtyard, how terrible will be the morning of those who were warned!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 177,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3966,
      "text": "And turn away from them for a while.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
